---
import SectionContainer from '../../components/SectionContainer.astro'
---

<section class="about" id="nosotros">
  <SectionContainer>
    <div class="about-quote">
      <h2 class="quote-text">"No construimos edificios. Construimos el marco de la vida de las personas."</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="about-content">
      <div class="about-image">
        <img 
          alt="Architectural Studio" 
          src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/aida-public/AB6AXuA90ekFmZTZ_SF0435a35od5zoiZJT0wlqGys9JHlSAR6W2QZ7QNfcI0fHwJrltl6TKPzixTO9TjQfjLvY6gqD7Vx6BFdMOJoNCm21jmIr0vtuOw652m7ha3qKLbWDhuSX_1dUCpj-5AkPmJaTlASkOIAoX-BUjaEghtsmXH4Uwi9bHsq-8aij110u9cnXZlDj9jARMNqlqh8-a2g7Dh_wfUc92oExpfu4m7udx1xzqwsCx9_hVbtsYey0ZI7tMihKTRzFZ2TuIJE0b" 
        />
      </div>
      <div class="about-items">
        <div class="about-item">
          <span class="about-item-number">01 / FILOSOFÍA</span>
          <h3 class="about-item-title">Esencia Material</h3>
          <p class="about-item-desc">Buscamos la pureza en el material. El concreto, el acero y la luz son nuestros pinceles para crear espacios que resisten la prueba del tiempo.</p>
          <div class="about-item-line"></div>
        </div>
        <div class="about-item">
          <span class="about-item-number">02 / PROCESO</span>
          <h3 class="about-item-title">Rigor Técnico</h3>
          <p class="about-item-desc">La precisión es nuestra obsesión. Desde el primer boceto hasta la entrega final, cada milímetro es cuestionado y validado.</p>
          <div class="about-item-line"></div>
        </div>
        <div class="about-item">
          <span class="about-item-number">03 / IMPACTO</span>
          <h3 class="about-item-title">Legado Humano</h3>
          <p class="about-item-desc">Un edificio solo es exitoso si mejora el bienestar de quienes lo habitan y el entorno que lo rodea.</p>
          <div class="about-item-line"></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </SectionContainer>
  <div class="about-ticker">
    <div class="ticker-content">
      <span>Pritzker Nominee 2023</span>
      <span>AIA Honor Award</span>
      <span>Mies van der Rohe Finalist</span>
      <span>Architizer A+ Gold</span>
      <span>Global Architecture Prize</span>
      <span>Design for All Merit</span>
      <span>Pritzker Nominee 2023</span>
      <span>AIA Honor Award</span>
      <span>Mies van der Rohe Finalist</span>
      <span>Architizer A+ Gold</span>
      <span>Global Architecture Prize</span>
      <span>Design for All Merit</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .about {
    padding-top: 160px;
    padding-bottom: 160px;
  }

  .about-quote {
    margin-bottom: 120px;
    max-width: 960px;
  }

  .quote-text {
    font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
    font-style: italic;
    font-size: 48px;
    line-height: 1.2;
    color: var(--color-primary);
  }

  @media (min-width: 769px) {
    .quote-text {
      font-size: 64px;
    }
  }

  .about-content {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: 48px;
    align-items: center;
  }

  @media (min-width: 769px) {
    .about-content {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      gap: 64px;
    }
  }

  .about-image {
    transform: rotate(-3deg);
    transition: transform 0.7s ease;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .about-image:hover {
    transform: rotate(0);
  }

  .about-image img {
    width: 100%;
    height: 500px;
    object-fit: cover;
    filter: grayscale(100%);
    transition: filter 0.7s ease;
  }

  @media (min-width: 769px) {
    .about-image img {
      height: 600px;
    }
  }

  .about-image:hover img {
    filter: grayscale(0);
  }

  .about-items {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 48px;
    margin-top: 48px;
  }

  @media (min-width: 769px) {
    .about-items {
      margin-top: 0;
    }
  }

  .about-item {
    cursor: pointer;
  }

  .about-item-number {
    font-family: var(--font-technical-data);
    font-size: 12px;
    color: var(--color-primary);
    display: block;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }

  .about-item-title {
    font-family: var(--font-headline-sm);
    font-size: 24px;
    line-height: 32px;
    color: var(--color-on-surface);
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }

  .about-item-desc {
    font-family: var(--font-body-md);
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 24px;
    color: var(--color-on-surface-variant);
  }

  .about-item-line {
    width: 0;
    height: 1px;
    background-color: var(--color-primary);
    margin-top: 24px;
    transition: width 0.5s ease;
  }

  .about-item:hover .about-item-line {
    width: 100%;
  }

  .about-ticker {
    margin-top: 120px;
    overflow: hidden;
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(77, 70, 60, 0.3);
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(77, 70, 60, 0.3);
    padding: 32px 0;
  }

  .ticker-content {
    display: flex;
    gap: 80px;
    white-space: nowrap;
    animation: marquee 30s linear infinite;
  }

  .ticker-content span {
    font-family: var(--font-technical-data);
    font-size: 24px;
    color: var(--color-on-surface);
    opacity: 0.3;
  }
</style>
